OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Aremove juror from murder trial after
OL,5,Atense exchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge sends the jury home for the
OL,8,Fnight in the trial of Lindsay Clancy,
OL,9,Fwho is accused of killing her three
OL,10,Fsmall children in Massachusetts in 2023
OL,12,FThe dismissal comes after Clancy's
OL,13,Flawyer Kevin Reddington asked the judge
OL,14,Fto remove one juror who he says isn't
OL,15,Ffollowing the rules - here's what he
OL,16,Fsaid to the judge
OL,18,FBut the judge has instructed the jurors
OL,19,Fto come back on Friday morning to
OL,20,Fcontinue deliberations - the third time
OL,21,Fthey have received this instruction
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
