OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Aremove juror from murder trial after
OL,5,Atense exchange
OL,6,
OL,7,FClancy is charged with three counts of
OL,8,Ffirst-degree murder, as the prosecution
OL,9,Fargues she made a calculated,
OL,10,Fintentional decision to kill them
OL,12,FThe 36-year-old former nurse does not
OL,13,Fdispute killing her two sons and
OL,14,Fdaughter, but her lawyer argues she was
OL,15,Fsuffering from postpartum psychosis at
OL,16,Fthe time, and therefore could not
OL,17,Fdistinguish right from wrong
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
